_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064006525:1":{"text":"칠책, 마법 상식 좀 채워 넣어!","source_cn":"齐尔查克，你真应该补点魔法常识了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B3EF758296D09C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064006526:1":{"text":"센시, 수염도 씻는 거 잊지 마.","source_cn":"森西，泡完记得洗胡子。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3BCD23E1579F0D45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064006527:1":{"text":"...알겠네.","source_cn":"……知道了。<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x657A10B5D77F1348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064006528:1":{"text":"나도 머릿결 관리 좀 해야겠다.","source_cn":"我待会也要好好护理头发呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B8C81E42346B16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064006529:1":{"text":"그러고 보니... 멀린, 네 머릿결 정말 좋은데? 평소에 어떻게 관리해?","source_cn":"说到这个……梅林，你的头发好有光泽，平时都是怎么保养的啊？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8DE5D4DB8CCD5558","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:46:1064006529":{"text":"그러고 보니... 멀린, 네 머릿결 정말 좋은데? 평소에 어떻게 관리해?","source_cn":"说到这个……梅林，你的头发好有光泽，平时都是怎么保养的啊？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8DE5D4DB8CCD5558","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064006530:1":{"text":"뭐?! 그 능력은 너무 반칙이잖아!","source_cn":"什么？！这能力也太作弊了吧。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x6BEE184A0D10D660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064006531:1":{"text":"마스터는 얼굴도 마음대로 바꾸실 수 있어요.","source_cn":"主人还能随意改变长相。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x59D4984D3AB588D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064006532:1":{"text":"젠장, 젠장. 부러워!","source_cn":"可恶，可恶！好嫉妒！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x464127126D458CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064006533:1":{"text":"나도 이런 고급 마법 좀 배우고 싶다.","source_cn":"我也想学这种高级魔法！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x80E6A07EB6B4741E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064006534:1":{"text":"미궁에서 외모 관리하기 정말 어렵단 말이야...","source_cn":"在迷宫里，外表总是很难打理……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0EF188906302E328","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064006535:1":{"text":"제대로 쉴 시간도 없고.","source_cn":"还总是没时间好好休息。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x55465FA384A81201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064006536:1":{"text":"이렇게 온천을 즐기는 것도 정말 오랜만이네.","source_cn":"现在能享受温泉，也算是难得的惊喜了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x128660ECF30B792B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064006537:0":{"text":"맞아. 그러니 이런 시간을 정말 소중히 여겨야지...","source_cn":"说得也是，这种时刻真该好好珍惜啊……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA4F3304DC9B523DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:62:1064006538:0":{"text":"시간이 흐르자 정신적 상처로 인한 피로가 점점 사라졌다","source_cn":"随着时间推移，精神创伤带来的疲惫渐渐消退。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD95D431E4EB7915E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:63:1064006539:0":{"text":"그리고 “집사” 로잔이 우리를 위한 저녁 만찬을 준비해 주었다","source_cn":"与此同时，“管家”洛桑，也为你们准备好了晚餐——","statu